Note: two claims that support each other; the second refuses inside its condition at its second evaluation.
§1 Let xs be a list of 1 copies of 1.
§2 We claim that 1 equals 1, by the owner, given §3.1.
§3 For each i from 1 to 2, do the following.
§3.1 We claim that item i of xs equals 1, by the owner, given §2.
